[al:新概念英语第一册]
[ti:135. The Latest Report]
[00:00.500]Lesson 135 | 第135课
[00:03.280]Are you really going to retire, Miss Marsh? | 马什小姐，你真的要退休吗？
[00:06.930]I may, I can't make up my mind. | 也许吧，我还没下定决心。
[00:10.135]I shall have to ask my future husband. | 我得问问我未来的丈夫。
[00:12.800]He won't let me make another film. | 他不会让我再拍电影了。
[00:15.735]Your future husband, Miss Marsh? | 你未来的丈夫，马什小姐？
[00:18.240]Yes. | 是的。
[00:19.305]Let me introduce him to you. | 我来把他介绍给你。
[00:21.690]His name is Carlos. | 他叫卡洛斯。
[00:23.870]We shall get married next week. | 我们下周就结婚。
[00:27.140]Look, Millie, here's another report about Karen Marsh. | 瞧，米莉，这是另一篇关于卡伦·马什的报道。
[00:32.410]Listen. Karen Marsh, the latest. | 听着。卡伦·马什，最新消息。
[00:36.380]At her London hotel today, | 今天在她伦敦的酒店，
[00:39.060]Miss Marsh told reporters she might retire. | 马什小姐告诉记者她可能会退休。
[00:42.585]She said she couldn't make up her mind. | 她说她还没下定决心。
[00:45.550]She said she would have to ask her future husband. | 她说她得问问她未来的丈夫。
[00:49.295]She said her future husband would not let her make another film. | 她说她未来的丈夫不会让她再拍电影。
[00:53.805]Then she introduced us to Carlos. | 然后她把卡洛斯介绍给我们。
[00:56.570]And told us they would get married next week. | 并告诉我们他们下周结婚。
[01:00.170]That's sensational news, isn't it, Kate? | 真是轰动性的新闻，不是吗，凯特？
[01:04.130]It certainly is. He'll be her sixth husband. | 确实是。他将是她的第六任丈夫。